>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__media" style="background-image:url('assets/img/rw-akagera.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">Rwanda · Itinerary</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Big Game &amp; Lake Kivu</h1>
      <div class="itin-meta reveal">
        <span><b>6 days</b></span>
        <span>Akagera · Lake Kivu</span>
        <span>Private</span>
        <span>from <b>$6,200</b> / person</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__actions reveal" style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a href="contact.html?trip=Big%20Game%20%26%20Lake%20Kivu" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this trip</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="rwanda.html">Rwanda</a> / Big Game &amp; Lake Kivu</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">The other side of Rwanda, beyond the gorillas lies a classic Big Five safari. Restored Akagera, on the eastern border, now teems with lion, elephant and rhino across rolling savanna and papyrus lakes, while the calm shores of Lake Kivu offer the perfect, restful counterpoint.</p>
        <p>A wonderful gorilla free safari in its own right, or an easy add on for those who want savanna as well as forest.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your 6 day journey</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 1</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Arrive in Kigali</h3><p>Met at the airport for a short city tour, the moving Genocide Memorial and a vibrant craft market, and an overnight in the capital.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Kigali boutique hotel · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 2</div><div class="day__body"><h3>To Akagera</h3><p>An easy drive east to Akagera National Park, with an afternoon game drive through golden savanna as the light softens.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Akagera tented camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 3</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Akagera Big Five</h3><p>A full day of game drives in search of lion, elephant, buffalo and reintroduced rhino, plus a relaxed afternoon boat safari among hippo and birds on Lake Ihema.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Akagera tented camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 4</div><div class="day__body"><h3>West to Lake Kivu</h3><p>A scenic transfer across the country (or a quick connecting flight) to the lakeside town of Gisenyi on the shores of Lake Kivu.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Lake Kivu lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 5</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Lake Kivu at leisure</h3><p>A gentle day by the lake, a boat to the islands, a coffee farm visit, swimming and sundowners over the water.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Lake Kivu lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 6</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Return to Kigali &amp; depart</h3><p>A scenic drive back to Kigali for a last lunch and your onward flight.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Where you'll stay</p><h2 class="section__title">Camps &amp; lodges</h2></div>
      <div class="related__grid reveal">
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Big%20Game%20%26%20Lake%20Kivu"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-tent.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Magashi Camp</h3><p>Lakeside tents in wild Akagera.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Big%20Game%20%26%20Lake%20Kivu"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-suite.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Ruzizi Tented Lodge</h3><p>Eco tents on the shore of Lake Ihema.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Big%20Game%20%26%20Lake%20Kivu"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-view.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Cleo Lake Kivu</h3><p>A serene retreat on the lake shore.</p></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="incl reveal">
        <div class="section__head section__head--left"><p class="eyebrow">All taken care of</p><h2 class="section__title">What's included</h2></div>
        <ul class="incl__grid">
          <li>All transfers (and any connecting flight)</li>
          <li>Hand picked camp &amp; lakeside lodge</li>
          <li>Private 4x4 game drives in Akagera</li>
          <li>Akagera boat safari &amp; all park fees</li>
          <li>Lake Kivu boat excursion</li>
          <li>All meals as shown</li>
          <li>Kigali city tour &amp; drinking water</li>
          <li>24/7 Rendile concierge &amp; all gratuities</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">From <strong>$6,200 per person sharing</strong>; single supplement available. International flights and visas are extra. Game viewing is good year round; the drier months (June to September &amp; December to February) concentrate wildlife around the water.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container reveal"><h2>Savanna &amp; lake, side by side.</h2><p>Tell us your dates and pace, and your designer will tailor the journey around you.</p><a href="contact.html?trip=Big%20Game%20%26%20Lake%20Kivu" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this trip</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
